设二次型$f \left( x_{1}, x_{2} \right)=x_{1}^{2}-4 x_{1} x_{2}+4 x_{2}^{2}$经正交变换$\binom{x_{1}}{x_{2}}=Q \binom{y_{1}}{y_{2}}$化为二次型$g \left( y_{1}, y_{2} \right)=a y_{1}^{2}+4 y_{1} y_{2}+b y_{2}^{2}$其中$a \geqslant b$.

I. 求 a,b的值;

II. 求正交矩阵 Q.

设向量组$\alpha_{1}=(1,2,1)^{\mathrm{T}},\alpha_{2}=(1,3,2)^{\mathrm{T}},\alpha_{3}=(1,a,3)^{\mathrm{T}}$为$\mathbf{R}^{3}$的一个基，$\beta=(1,1,1)^{\mathrm{T}}$在这个基下的坐标为$(b,c,1)^{\mathrm{T}}$.

I. 求 a,b,c ;

II. 证明$\alpha_{2},\alpha_{3},\beta$为$\mathbf{R}^{3}$的一个基，并求$\alpha_{2},\alpha_{3},\beta$到$\alpha_{1},\alpha_{2},\alpha_{3}$的过渡矩阵.

已知矩阵$A = \left( \begin{array}{c c c} - 2 & - 2 & 1 \\ 2 & x & - 2 \\ 0 & 0 & - 2 \end{array} \right)$与$B = \left( \begin{array}{c c c} 2 & 1 & 0 \\ 0 & - 1 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & y \end{array} \right)$相似.

I. 求 x,y;

II. 求可逆矩阵$P$使得$P^{-1}AP = B$.

设$A=\left( \begin{array}{c c c} \lambda & 1 & 1 \\ 0 & \lambda-1 & 0 \\ 1 & 1 & \lambda \end{array} \right), b=\left( \begin{array}{c} a \\ 1 \\ 1 \end{array} \right).$已知线性方程组$A x=b$存在2个不同的解.

I. 求$\lambda, a$;

II. 求方程组$A x=b$的通解.
